																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"675135430408014289","clan_steamid":"103582791475547876","event_name":"Nekome: Nazi Hunter - Meet Hitler's Hyenas\u00a0","event_type":28,"appid":4200110,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792681500,"rtime32_end_time":1792685040,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"36bdf21e5b875682024763f165660a11c0050045.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"29c90335f07aa35089b79e245a5e4bc71b901393.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"675135430408014290","clanid":"46026468","posterid":"0","headline":"Nekome: Nazi Hunter - Meet Hitler's Hyenas\u00a0","posttime":1792681546,"updatetime":1792681546,"body":"[p]Today we're introducing some of the monsters Vano will cross paths with in Nekome - [b]Hitler's Hyenas[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]They're some of the regime's most vicious officers and enforcers, each notorious for their cruelty and each presenting Vano with a very different kind of problem.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Watch the latest Nekome Dev Log below to find out, or if you prefer the written word - we've got you covered. Read on for the full Dev Log.[\/p][p][\/p][previewyoutube=\"_7arTAUdghQ;full\"][\/previewyoutube][p][\/p][h3][b]Who are Hitler's Hyenas?[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]The Hyenas aren't a formal unit. They're a collection of Nazi officers and enforcers who have earned reputations for their cruelty and their own particular ways of making everyone else's life considerably worse.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]As Vano's journey takes him through post-war Europe, he's going to become very well acquainted with them - so, let's make some introductions.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46026468\/561e23f12303d6e7f7dc399204a4fec93f605d51.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]Otto Braun - The Beast[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p]A towering SS Commandant who prefers solving problems with overwhelming force.\u00a0Otto is brutal, impulsive and considerably more comfortable breaking bones than making plans.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Fortunately for Otto, thinking isn't much of a requirement for either.\u00a0[\/p][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]Hans M\u00fcller - The Handsome[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p]An SS officer whose vanity is matched only by his cruelty.\u00a0From a commandeered ch\u00e2teau in occupied France, Hans surrounds himself with stolen art, lavish parties and the Nazi elite.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]He's handsome. He knows it. And he'd really rather you didn't touch the face.\u00a0[\/p][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]Ursula Vogel - The Witch[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p]A commander operating deep within Germany's Black Forest.\u00a0Where Otto's violence is explosive, Ursula's is deliberate. Precise.\u00a0Her reputation has spread far enough that among those trying to escape her, she's become something closer to a ghost story.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Unlike most ghost stories, this one carries a knife.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]Klaus Schultz - The Cruel[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p]A Nazi propagandist who prefers cameras and carefully constructed traps to the battlefield.\u00a0From his film studio in Nuremberg, Klaus orchestrates suffering like a director, manipulating those around him and making sure everything happens according to his script.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Unfortunately for Klaus, Vano isn't particularly good at following directions.\u00a0[\/p][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]More Than a Bigger Health Bar[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]The Hyenas aren't just important to Vano's story. They're also an opportunity for us to challenge the way you play Nekome.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Throughout the game, we're teaching you a set of rules; read the space around you, decide when to remain unseen, know when to make noise, and when the opportunity presents itself, finish the fight with the knife.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]The Hyenas are where we get to start messing with those rules.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]We didn't want these encounters to simply mean giving an enemy a bigger health bar and asking you to hit them for longer.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Each Hyena presents a different kind of encounter designed to challenge the way you've learned to play.\u00a0A tactic you've relied upon might suddenly disappear. A Hyena might refuse to fight on your terms, and sometimes, figuring out how to reach them is just as important as the confrontation itself.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]But we're not going to spoil exactly what each of them has waiting for Vano - where would be the fun in that?\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]If you'd like a closer look at the people standing in his way, we've just released a brand-new trailer introducing Hitler's Hyenas.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][previewyoutube=\"HK9gmYccB4w;full\"][\/previewyoutube][p][\/p][p]You'll be seeing plenty more of them as Vano's journey continues.\u00a0[\/p][p]Whether they like it or not.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]Wishlist Nekome on Steam and follow us for more on the road to launch.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/4200110\/Nekome_Nazi_Hunter\/\"]https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/4200110\/Nekome_Nazi_Hunter\/[\/url][\/p]","commentcount":3,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1827889981_1792684983_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"568174939259166780","event_gid":"675135430408014289","voteupcount":37,"votedowncount":2,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"568174939259166780","rtime32_last_modified":1793138072,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792684984,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792589296,"votes_up":37,"votes_down":2,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"569288789836481833","gidfeature2":"568174939259166780"},{"gid":"670631196372240008","clan_steamid":"103582791475547876","event_name":"The Nekome Demo is LIVE NOW \ud83d\udd2a","event_type":31,"appid":4200110,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792429740,"rtime32_end_time":1792430580,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"f327120d177000d2573e3d56ea11a83e6227bb57.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"d05cd2d9d03c4cdaca5b05ce01649ecb66f60ab9.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"670631196372240009","clanid":"46026468","posterid":"0","headline":"The Nekome Demo is LIVE NOW \ud83d\udd2a","posttime":1792429766,"updatetime":1792435824,"body":"[p]You\u2019ve watched Vano stab, punch, shoot and generally make life very unpleasant for Nazis - [b]Now it\u2019s your turn![\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p]The [b]Nekome: Nazi Hunter[\/b] demo is officially LIVE NOW on Steam during Steam Next Fest, October 19 \u2013 26.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]The demo gives you an early taste of [b]Horde of the Reich[\/b], an extra game mode coming to Nekome that puts your combat skills to the test across [b]25 increasingly challenging stages[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]What can you do in the demo?[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]\ud83d\udd2a [b]Survive 25 stages[\/b] of increasingly challenging combat\u00a0[\/p][p]\ud83e\udd77 [b]Go stealthy[\/b] and take enemies down quietly\u00a0[\/p][p]\ud83d\udc4a [b]Get into a brawl[\/b] with attacks, dodges and parries\u00a0[\/p][p]\ud83d\udd2b [b]Steal enemy guns[\/b] and turn them against their owners\u00a0[\/p][p]\ud83e\uddf1 [b]Grab whatever you can find[\/b] - bricks, bottles and more are all fair game\u00a0[\/p][p]\ud83d\udcaa [b]Unlock new skills[\/b] as you progress\u00a0[\/p][p]\ud83c\udfc6 [b]Set your high score[\/b] - then come back and beat it\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]How you make it through is up to you.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]Think you can set the high score?[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]We want to see how you do. Join us on the [url=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/playnekome\"][b]Nekome Discord[\/b][\/url] and share your best runs and high scores with the community.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]And while you\u2019re there, [b]tell us what you think.[\/b]\u00a0This is an early test of Horde of the Reich, and we're sharing it now because we genuinely want your feedback while we're still making the game - [b]good or bad, we want to hear it.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Tell us what you loved. Tell us what you didn't. Tell us what felt great, what felt weird, what you think needs changing, and what you'd like to see more of.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]And if something breaks along the way, please report any bugs you encounter too. The more information you can give us, the more useful it is for the team.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]We're reading your feedback, and it will help us make Nekome better.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]Now go kill some Nazis \ud83d\udd2a[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/4200110\/Nekome_Nazi_Hunter\/\"]https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/4200110\/Nekome_Nazi_Hunter\/[\/url][\/p]","commentcount":14,"tags":["ModAct_783923276_1792449315_2_31","mod_reviewed","ModAct_783923276_1792449322_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"568174730608217008","event_gid":"670631196372240008","voteupcount":65,"votedowncount":3,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1792429740,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"568174730608217008","rtime32_last_modified":1793190261,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792449322,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792419966,"votes_up":65,"votes_down":3,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"569288789836481833","gidfeature2":"568174730608217008"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["675135430408014290","670631196372240009"],"last_update_event":[]}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.poster.avif?t=1792439176" width=1170 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.webm?t=1792439176" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.mp4?t=1792439176" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i>Nekome: Nazi Hunter</i> is a single-player, third-person action game following Vano Nastasu, a young Romani man driven by grief and vengeance after Nazi soldiers brutally murder his family. Transform from hunted to hunter in an odyssey of revenge across a war-torn world.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Scout enemy routes, plan your attacks, and strike with precision through stealth and close-quarters combat.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Inspired by grindhouse cinema, <i>Nekome</i> delivers visceral combat, grounded finishing moves, and encounters where every action carries consequences.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>REVENGE IS PERSONAL</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Each mission begins in the enemy’s backyard, where you’ll stalk Nazis, assassinate guards, and set traps to frighten your foes. Enemy awareness is shared and persistent—kill carelessly and patrols respond, wait too long and reinforcements arrive. Stealth isn’t about avoiding the fight. It’s about stacking the odds before the true combat begins.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.poster.avif?t=1792439176" width=1170 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.webm?t=1792439176" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.mp4?t=1792439176" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>STRATEGIC COMBAT</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every encounter is your chance to craft a savage masterpiece. Melee is raw, brutal, and bloody, built for life-or-death, close quarters fighting with each punch, stab, and parry making an impact. Use improvised weapons to gain the advantage over enemies who adapt to your fighting style, slow down combat to chain targeted strikes into cinematic assaults, and bring the violence to a finale with visceral finishing blows.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.poster.avif?t=1792439176" width=1170 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.webm?t=1792439176" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.mp4?t=1792439176" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>NOTORIETY AND FEAR</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Notoriety and fear systems add another layer to combat, allowing you to make an example of your enemies and watch their morale collapse. Fear becomes a formidable weapon earned through surgical, savage tactics. Kill with precision or create chaos, and enemies may panic, hesitate, or flee. The notoriety system tracks your brutality and unpredictability, influencing the enemies’ next actions. Some Nazis may rush in blindly, while others refuse to enter the room.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.poster.avif?t=1792439176" width=1170 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.webm?t=1792439176" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200110/extras/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.mp4?t=1792439176" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>THE WORLD IS YOUR WEAPON</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fight with fists, blades, guns, and whatever the environment provides. Nazi-occupied spaces are filled with pipes, tools, and hazards waiting to be used as improvised weapons. Choose your path, set your traps, and weaponize the world against your enemies.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
